# Citation Integrity in Frontier Language Models: Author Misattribution and Fabrication in Research-Agent Conditions

**Author:** Anubhav Sapkota  
**Affiliation:** GrayTell Labs  
**Date:** September 18, 2026  
**Contact:** sapkotaanubhav91@gmail.com

